Beam me up {2}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for {2}{W} if you also return a creature you control to its owner's hand. Then exile this spell.)"""@en ;
    :oracleText """Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures.
Beam me up {2}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for {2}{W} if you also return a creature you control to its owner's hand. Then exile this spell.)"""@en ;
